{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41967","headline":"海上太守新剏东亭 · 李中","name":"海上太守新剏东亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"使君心智杳难同，选胜开亭景莫穷。\n高敞轩窗迎海月，预栽花木待春风。\n静披典籍堪师古，醉拥笙歌不碍公。\n满径苔纹疎雨後，入檐山色夕阳中。\n偏宜下榻延徐孺，最称登门礼孔融。\n事简岂妨频赏翫，况当爲政有余功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41967.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41967","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}